#X obj 653 8 flow.less_eq;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 225 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 the object routes the incoming numbers to the outlets
according to the compare values: a number that is less than or equal
to the first value goes to the first outlet \, a number less than or
equal to the N-th value goes to the N-th outlet;
#X text 240 168 numbers greater than the last compare value are sent
to the last outlet;
#X text 240 208 the compare values must be in ascending order;
#X text 240 233 the object can be used to split a numeric stream into
ranges \, for example to map note pitches to different instruments
or to divide a sensor range into zones;
